From 01a8193e746049bf6de87aac579c5e7f15070afd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 15:01:38 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] soc: mediatek: publish MT6797 DVFSP handoff access

Wait for a terminal handoff result before binding and retain denied terminal states for inspection.

Publish the access grant only after late stopped-firmware validation.

Record the shared AP-DMA gate without making it a supplier-readiness predicate. Require both I2C bulk-clock domains while held and prove cleanup over a bounded 32-sample window.

Export guarded sleepable PM checks and preserve supplier ordering across sleep.

Signed-off-by: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
